      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">בַּאֲשֶׁר</span></big><sub>19</sub> <strong>a.</strong> <em>naquilo que</em> … <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.4\">Is 56:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.12\">65:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.4\">66:4</a> (acima, <strong>1</strong>); <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:9\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.9\">Ec 3:9</a> <em>em (aquilo) que, no que</em> (<strong>4 c</strong>); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.12\">Is 47:12</a> (veja-se <strong>2</strong>).<br><strong>b.</strong> <strong>advérbio:</strong> <em>no (lugar) onde</em>; acima, <strong>4 b</strong> (γ).<br><strong>c.</strong> <strong>conjunção:</strong> <em>pelo fato de que, visto que</em>, †<a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:9\" href=\"/Genesis.39.9\">Gn 39:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:23\" href=\"/Genesis.39.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.2\">Ec 7:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.4\">8:4</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܕ</span>.<br><strong>d.</strong> †<a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:8\" href=\"/Jonah.1.8\">Jon 1:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּאֲשֶׁר לְמִי</span>, <em>por causa de quem?</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בַּאֲשֶׁר לְ</span>, <em>por causa de</em>, formado segundo o modelo do aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּדִיל</span>; veja-se sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, שֶׁל\" href=\"/BDB,_שֶׁל\", dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁל</a>).",
